# Prettier ignores.
#
# Why this file exists, in one paragraph: this repository was hand-formatted,
# not Prettier-formatted. Measured across frontend/src, 1751 source lines exceed
# 100 characters and the longest is 349. Running Prettier at any printWidth
# rewrites 155-170 of the 252 source files, and the rewrite is not a whitespace
# adjustment - it collapses hand-wrapped import lists and rewraps long lines
# throughout the tree.
#
# docs/FEATURE-CONTRACT.md is why that matters. A feature branch owns its own
# folder under src/features/** and no other branch may edit it. Landing a commit
# that reformats all 48 feature folders at once would make every in-flight
# feature branch conflict on every file simultaneously, which is the precise
# failure the plugin host exists to prevent.
#
# So: Prettier is configured, and it runs on the files a branch legitimately
# owns. It is deliberately NOT run as a one-off reformat over the existing tree.
# Feature and page files are listed below, so `npm run format` is a no-op on
# them rather than a 152-file rewrite. Each is formatted by the branch that owns
# it, when that branch next touches the file.
#
# Consequence, stated plainly: `npm run format:check` is expected to report
# these files as unformatted. That is a known, accepted state, not a CI failure.
# The pre-commit hook does not run format:check.

dist
coverage
node_modules

# --- The shared host files -------------------------------------------------
# Every feature branch must leave these byte-identical (check_feature_diff.py),
# so a formatter has no business rewriting them. These three are the remaining
# files Prettier would change; the rest of the host already matches.
src/App.jsx
src/components/ui.jsx
src/lib/api.js

# --- Existing feature folders ----------------------------------------------
# Contract-protected. Reformatting them here would collide with every feature
# branch in flight.
src/features/

# --- Existing pages and test fixtures --------------------------------------
# Same reasoning as the feature folders: hand-authored, contract-adjacent, and
# not this branch's to rewrite wholesale.
src/pages/
src/test/

# Generated at build time.
src/**/*.css
